msgstr "<b>SBC require reporto definite</b>: Definir <tt>C</tt> ante subtraher (functiona como prestito inverse). <tt>C</tt> clar post SBC indica que un prestito occurreva."

#. TRANSLATORS: MDX-derived text from packages/learn/quick-help.mdx
msgid "<b>SP</b> (Stack Pointer): Points to current stack position (starts at <tt>$FF</tt>)"
msgstr "<b>SP</b> (Punctator de pila): Punta a position currente de pila (comencia a <tt>$FF</tt>)"

#. TRANSLATORS: MDX-derived text from packages/learn/quick-help.mdx
msgid "<b>STA/STX/STY</b>: Store registers to memory"
msgstr "<b>STA/STX/STY</b>: Immagazinar registros in memoria"

#. TRANSLATORS: MDX-derived text from packages/learn/quick-help.mdx
msgid "<b>Stack</b>: <tt>$0100</tt>-<tt>$01FF</tt>"
msgstr "<b>Pila</b>: <tt>$0100</tt>-<tt>$01FF</tt>"

#. TRANSLATORS: MDX-derived text from packages/learn/quick-help.mdx
msgid "<b>V</b> (Overflow): Set when arithmetic operation causes signed overflow"
msgstr "<b>V</b> (Transbordo): Definite quando operation arithmetic causa transbordo signate"

#. TRANSLATORS: MDX-derived text from packages/learn/quick-help.mdx
