msgid "Negative Flag: Set when the most significant bit (bit 7) of the result is 1. Used for signed number comparisons and indicates if a value is negative in two's complement representation."
msgstr "Bandiera negative: Definite quando le bit plus significante (bit 7) del resultato es 1. Usate pro comparationes de numeros signate e indica si un valor es negative in representation de complemento a duo."

