msgstr "Iste es le equivalente de pagina zero,X, ma pote solo esser usate con <tt>LDX</tt> e <tt>STX</tt>."

#. TRANSLATORS: MDX-derived text from packages/learn/tutorial.mdx
msgid "This is where addressing gets interesting. In this mode, a zero page address is given, and then the value of the <tt>X</tt> register is added. Here is an example:"
msgstr "Iste es ubi adressage deveni interessante. In iste modo, un adresse de pagina zero es date, e pois le valor del registro <tt>X</tt> es addite. Ecce un exemplo:"

#. TRANSLATORS: MDX-derived text from packages/learn/tutorial.mdx
msgid "This loads the value <tt>$11</tt> into the memory location <tt>$10</tt>, the value <tt>$10</tt> into <tt>$12</tt>, and <tt>$0f</tt> into <tt>$14</tt>. It then loads the value <tt>$04</tt> into <tt>$11</tt>, <tt>$13</tt> and <tt>$15</tt>. This leads to memory like this:"
msgstr "Iste carga le valor <tt>$11</tt> in le location de memoria <tt>$10</tt>, le valor <tt>$10</tt> in <tt>$12</tt>, e <tt>$0f</tt> in <tt>$14</tt>. Illo pois carga le valor <tt>$04</tt> in <tt>$11</tt>, <tt>$13</tt> e <tt>$15</tt>. Iste duci a memoria como isto:"

#. TRANSLATORS: MDX-derived text from packages/learn/tutorial.mdx
msgid "This one's kinda weird. It's like a cross between zero page,X and indirect. Basically, you take the zero page address, add the value of the <tt>X</tt> register to it, then use that to look up a two-byte address. For example:"
msgstr "Iste es un poc stran. Illo es como un cruce inter pagina zero,X e indirecte. Basicamente, tu prende le adresse de pagina zero, adde le valor del registro <tt>X</tt> a illo, pois usa illo pro recercar un adresse de duo bytes. Pro exemplo:"

#. TRANSLATORS: Release notes for version 0.4.0
msgid "This release brings vibrant handheld-inspired theming with customisable colours. We've introduced adaptive tablet and desktop layouts that keep everything in view, perfect for those marathon coding sessions when learning to develop retro games in assembly. Big thanks to our new contributor @mmartinortiz for the great desktop layout ideas. There are some cool technical improvements too, like TypeScript strictness, custom GtkSourceView style schemes, and enhanced debugger controls for smoother development."
msgstr "Iste liberation porta theming vibrante inspirate per apparatos manual con colores customisabile. Nos ha introducite dispositiones adaptive pro tabletta e scriptorio que mantene toto in vista, perfecte pro ille sessiones de codification marathon quando apprender a disveloppar jocos retro in assemblage. Grande gratias a nostre nove contributor @mmartinortiz pro le grande ideas de disposition de scriptorio. Il ha alcun fresias meliorationes technic tamben, como strictessa TypeScript, schemas de stilo GtkSourceView custom, e controles de debugger meliorate pro disveloppamento plus suave."

